      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_6",
        on: "branch_if_6",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "ally_race",
            equals: "dwarf",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$ally_id",
            text: _("Yes, this time of year the snow melts from the mountains, and rivers like this often go deep underground. Sometimes the rivers break through and flood caverns, a deadly accident that has occasionally befallen my kind."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_7",
        on: "branch_if_7",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "ally_race",
            not_equals: "dwarf",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$ally_id",
            text: _("Deep and dark are the waters that flow in our caves. Sometimes raging waters flood tunnels without warning. A stream can sustain a village, a sudden flood can destroy it."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_8",
        on: "branch_if_8",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "ally_race",
            equals: "dwarf",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_1",
            type: "Troll Rocklobber",
            side: 6,
            x: 50,
            y: 44,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_1",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_2",
            type: "Troll Whelp",
            side: 6,
            x: 51,
            y: 43,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_2",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_3",
            type: "Troll Shaman",
            side: 6,
            x: 51,
            y: 44,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_3",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "avenger",
            text: _("Foul elves, you not escaped us yet. Great Leader will be avenged! We plugged river and you all drown with us!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_9",
        on: "branch_if_9",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "ally_race",
            not_equals: "dwarf",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_4",
            type: "Dwarvish Fighter",
            side: 6,
            x: 50,
            y: 44,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_4",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_5",
            type: "Dwarvish Thunderguard",
            side: 6,
            x: 51,
            y: 43,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_5",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_6",
            type: "Dwarvish Pathfinder",
            side: 6,
            x: 51,
            y: 44,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_6",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "avenger",
            text: _("Foul elves, you have not escaped yet. Our chieftain shall be avenged! We have dammed the river and soon all shall drown in its dark waters. Come join us in death!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_5",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$ally_id",
            text: _("We’ve come far and we’re almost to the surface. But first we should stop and rest here for a while."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("That’s a big river; the water is really moving fast."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_6",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_7",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Well, the faster we get out of here, the happier I’ll be."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "cave-in.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("Wait, did you feel that?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            portrait: "portraits/nym_moody.webp",
            text: _("What?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("It felt like a distant rumbling. And what’s that roaring sound?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_8",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_9",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("That sound must be the rushing water. We have to get our people out of here, and fast!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$ally_id",
            text: _("Quick, the southern passage!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("We haven’t a moment to lose!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_11",
        on: "branch_if_11",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "unit.id",
            equals: "$ally_id",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Hey look, ants!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_12",
        on: "branch_if_12",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "unit.id",
            not_equals: "$ally_id",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Hey look, more ants!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_13",
        on: "branch_if_13",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "unit.id",
            not_equals: "Nym",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Are you sure there aren’t any spiders?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("No, but the water is rising to the southeast as well. The river must lead to more tunnels than we first thought."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_14",
        on: "branch_if_14",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "unit.id",
            equals: "Nym",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I don’t see any spiders, but the water is rising to the southeast as well. The river must lead to more tunnels than we first thought."),
          },
        ],
      },
