e%22%3A%22Hey%20look!%20It%E2%80%99s%20a%20troll!%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Durth%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Huh%3F%20A%20troll%3F%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Bellerin%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Yeah%2C%20just%20like%20my%20old%20grandmam%20used%20to%20tell%20us%3A%20dark%20gray%20skin%2C%20beady%20red%20eyes%2C%20hulking%20brutes%20with%20brains%20as%20small%20as%20a%20barnacle.%20They%20lurk%20deep%20in%20the%20earth%20and%20hate%20everything%20that%20lives%20above%20ground.%20This%20must%20be%20an%20invasion!%20The%20trolls%20must%20have%20started%20the%20flood!%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22set_variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22sealife_response%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22Fish%20bait%3F%20Barnacles%3F%20Who%20are%20these%20humans%20and%20what%20were%20they%20talking%20about%3F%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22case%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22value%22%3A%22dwarf%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Othgar%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Hey%20look!%20It%E2%80%99s%20a%20dwarf!%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Durth%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Huh%3F%20A%20dwarf%3F%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Bellerin%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Yeah%2C%20just%20like%20my%20old%20grandmam%20used%20to%20tell%20us%3A%20short%20and%20stocky%2C%20long%20beards%2C%20filthy%20bastards%20who%20are%20as%20sneaky%20as%20a%20cuttlefish.%20They%20lurk%20underground%20and%20only%20come%20up%20to%20steal%20whatever%20valuables%20they%20can%20get%20their%20hands%20on.%20This%20must%20part%20of%20their%20plot.%20The%20dwarves%20must%20have%20started%20the%20flood!%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22set_variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22sealife_response%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22Fish%20bait%3F%20Cuttlefish%3F%20Who%20are%20these%20humans%20and%20what%20were%20they%20talking%20about%3F%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22else%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Othgar%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Hey%20look!%20Those%20must%20be%20elves!%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Durth%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Huh%3F%20Elves%3F%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Bellerin%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Yeah%2C%20just%20like%20my%20old%20grandmam%20used%20to%20tell%20us%3A%20pointy%20ears%2C%20those%20shifty%20eyes%2C%20hearts%20as%20hard%20as%20a%20hermit%20crab%E2%80%99s%20shell.%20It%20must%20be%20an%20invasion!%20They%20must%20have%20started%20the%20flood!%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22set_variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22sealife_response%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22Fish%20bait%3F%20Hermit%20Crabs%3F%20Who%20are%20these%20humans%20and%20what%20were%20they%20talking%20about%3F%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Othgar%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Then%20let%E2%80%99s%20kill%20them!%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Durth%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Yeah!%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22unit%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22They%E2%80%99re%20definitely%20of%20the%20%E2%80%98attack%20first%2C%20ask%20questions%20later%E2%80%99%20variety.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
