          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durth",
            text: _("<i>Huff, huff.</i> First the boss tells us to patrol these caves, and then these durn caves start flooding. What next?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Bellerin",
            text: _("Shut up and keep running, or we’ll be fish-bait for sure!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "switch",
            variable: "unit.race",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "troll",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Othgar",
                    text: _("Hey look! It’s a troll!"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Durth",
                    text: _("Huh? A troll?"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Bellerin",
                    text: _("Yeah, just like my old grandmam used to tell us: dark gray skin, beady red eyes, hulking brutes with brains as small as a barnacle. They lurk deep in the earth and hate everything that lives above ground. This must be an invasion! The trolls must have started the flood!"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                    variable: "sealife_response",
                    value: "Fish bait? Barnacles? Who are these humans and what were they talking about?",
                    mode: "value",
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "dwarf",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Othgar",
                    text: _("Hey look! It’s a dwarf!"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Durth",
                    text: _("Huh? A dwarf?"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Bellerin",
                    text: _("Yeah, just like my old grandmam used to tell us: short and stocky, long beards, filthy bastards who are as sneaky as a cuttlefish. They lurk underground and only come up to steal whatever valuables they can get their hands on. This must part of their plot. The dwarves must have started the flood!"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "hook",
                    name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                    variable: "sealife_response",
                    value: "Fish bait? Cuttlefish? Who are these humans and what were they talking about?",
                    mode: "value",
                  },
                ],
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Othgar",
            text: _("Then let’s kill them!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Durth",
            text: _("Yeah!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("They’re definitely of the ‘attack first, ask questions later’ variety."),
          },
        ],
      },
