            speaker: "$ally_id",
            text: _("Wait. The chamber in front of us is probably trapped and well guarded. There is another way. When I explored here before, I found a secret passage that bypassed the main gate. Search along the southern wall of this cave and you should find it. The only problem is that the passage is long and windy, and it will cost us precious minutes. With the water rising that may be time we don’t have to spend. I leave the final decision up to you, Kaleh."),
          },
