          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22event%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22moveto%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22break_circle%22%2C%22first_time_only%22%3A%22no%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22unit%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22In%20the%20center%20of%20this%20circle%20is%20a%20huge%20creature%2C%20with%20surging%20muscles%20and%20bloodshot%20eyes.%20I%20would%20think%20it%20was%20just%20a%20very%20big%20man%2C%20except%20for%20the%20fine%20stitches%20that%20cover%20its%20entire%20body.%20In%20fact%20it%20seems%20to%20be%20composed%20of%20many%20body%20parts%20all%20sewn%20together.%20It%20seems%20to%20be%20floating%20asleep%20in%20the%20center%20of%20the%20glowing%20magical%20circle.%20I%20could%20scratch%20out%20part%20of%20the%20circle%20and%20break%20it%2C%20but%20I%20have%20no%20idea%20what%20the%20consequences%20would%20be.%20I%E2%80%99m%20not%20sure%20I%20want%20something%20with%20that%20kind%20of%20strength%20attacking%20me.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22option%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22label%22%3A%22Break%20the%20circle.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22command%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22remove_event%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22break_circle%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22remove_item%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%22%24x1%22%2C%22y%22%3A%22%24y1%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22remove_item%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%2218%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2229%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22unit%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22Flesh%20Golem%22%2C%22x%22%3A%2218%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2229%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Kromph%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22Kromph%22%2C%22upkeep%22%3A%22loyal%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Kromph%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Master%2C%20what%20is%20your%20command%3F%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22unit%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22What%3F!%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Kromph%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Kromph%20need%20command.%20Command%20me!%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Nym%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Follow%20us.%20Attack%20our%20enemies.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Kromph%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Yes%2C%20mistress.%20Kromph%20follow%20you.%20Kill%20enemies.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Zhul%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Quick%20thinking%2C%20Nym.%20It%20seems%20to%20be%20some%20sort%20of%20magical%20creation.%20Lucky%20that%20it%20thought%20we%20were%20its%20master.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Kaleh%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Looks%20like%20you%20have%20your%20own%20rather%20large%20pet%2C%20Nym.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Nym%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22It%20wouldn%E2%80%99t%20have%20been%20my%20first%20choice.%20But%20it%20could%20prove%20useful.%20I%20wonder%20what%20it%20likes%20to%20eat%3F%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22option%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22label%22%3A%22Leave%20that%20thing%20alone.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22command%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22allow_undo%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "dialogue",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "message",
                text: _("In the center of this circle is a huge creature, with surging muscles and bloodshot eyes. I would think it was just a very big man, except for the fine stitches that cover its entire body. In fact it seems to be composed of many body parts all sewn together. It seems to be floating asleep in the center of the glowing magical circle. I could scratch out part of the circle and break it, but I have no idea what the consequences would be. I’m not sure I want something with that kind of strength attacking me."),
              },
              {
                tag: "choice",
                text: _("Break the circle."),
                event: "break_circle_opt0",
              },
              {
                tag: "choice",
                text: _("Leave that thing alone."),
                event: "break_circle_opt1",
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
