      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_56",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: "16-23",
            y: "14-22",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:clear_shroud",
            side: 1,
            xs: "15-20,20-23",
            ys: "14-21,16-20",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_57",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_58",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$explorer.id",
            text: _("Look, daylight! I think we finally made it out of the caves!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_59",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$explorer.id",
            text: _("What’s this? Someone has built an outpost at the end of the cave. Where are its occupants?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_60",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Oh, Eloh. They’re all dead. Butchered. Quick, we have to clean this up, we don’t want the rest of our people to have to see such horror."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Now, Keratur, I will have my answers. Did you have a hand in this?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:unstore_unit",
            variable: "cloaked_figure",
            x: "$x1",
            y: "$y1",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cloaked Figure",
            text: _("They heard me and... and they got in the way. But they aren’t even elves, what do they matter?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("You idiot—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Quiet, Nym. But I still don’t understand how you got here. We were sure you were dead. We searched and searched, but never found your body."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cloaked Figure",
            text: _("Heh, heh, no you didn’t find me. I awoke trapped under the rubble, and when I finally escaped the village was deserted. Just the stink of death and destruction. And then I saw them, hordes of undead pouring down from across the dunes. A cabal of necromancers... they found me and made me watch, they made me watch it all!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Watch what?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cloaked Figure",
            text: _("They brought some humans, bound up tight. So beautiful... she had flaming red hair... they cut her... I can still hear her screaming. But that was only the beginning. They chanted words of power, and spilled the hot blood onto the sand and then I heard their screams of agony and pain..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("From the humans?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cloaked Figure",
            text: _("Faugh. No, I heard the screams of the dead, torn from their rest, their souls rose into the air howling in agony."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("But, but we burned the bodies so they couldn’t be raised."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cloaked Figure",
            text: _("Fool. That did not stop their dark power. Nothing could stop them. I felt the rush of flying spirits, and the unbearable cold, so cold. For a moment I felt their torment. But no, they wouldn’t kill me. They let me go as a witness and laughed as I scrambled over the dunes."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cloaked Figure",
            text: _("I was able to follow your trail, and I slipped among your people. No one noticed me, no I was too sneaky. And you wondered how I managed to follow you through the tunnels? Hah, you escorted me."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("But why, why did you want to kill us?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cloaked Figure",
            text: _("You abandoned them! The pain, the agony, I still see their ghostly faces and hear their wails. And the necromancers kept chanting one name over and over: Yechnagoth, Yechnagoth, it reverberated in my ears. And every time I sleep I hear that name, and laughter, hideous laughter. She kept telling me it was your fault. And I believed her. Kaleh, forgive me, I just wanted to make the pain stop."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("I... I forgive you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cloaked Figure",
            text: _("I do not fear death any more."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Cloaked Figure",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("He’s dead. Rest in peace. Oh, what have I done? All our dead kin, desecrated and tormented for eternity."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("As you said yourself, the past is the past, there is nothing you can do now."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            portrait: "portraits/nym_moody.webp",
            text: _("Don’t blame yourself. You didn’t know. If we had stayed behind we too would have been killed by the undead; we could not have defended our village against so many. We had no choice."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("That is small consolation. My deeds have turned to ashes in my mouth. Eloh forgive me. I did not know."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("With your permission, Kaleh, I think I should go scout around a bit outside. We have no idea what lies out there. And I can sneak around unseen many places you can’t."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("You can go Nym, just be careful."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("I’m always careful. I’ll be back soon."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "Nymstats",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Nym",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Well, at least we can use this outpost to rally our surviving troops. How many of our people made it out of the caves, Zhul?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("We’re still trying to get a head count, but between the underground horrors and the water, we lost quite a few. Recruiting new warriors is going to be even more difficult. Still we should thank Eloh, and you, Kaleh, that so many of us did survive."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "num",
            value: "$recruit_cost_extra",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "recruit_cost_extra",
            value: 2,
            mode: "add",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_62",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_recruit",
            side: 1,
            mode: "disallow",
            types: "Quenoth Fighter$num,Tauroch Rider$num,Quenoth Scout$num,Quenoth Mystic$num",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "num",
            value: "$recruit_cost_extra",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_recruit",
            side: 1,
            mode: "allow",
            types: "Quenoth Fighter$num,Tauroch Rider$num,Quenoth Scout$num,Quenoth Mystic$num",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Well, Nym’s right, we don’t know what’s out there. So we should set up a perimeter guard around the cave mouth and start discovering what this side of the mountains looks like."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "ally_must_live",
            value: "no",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:show_objectives",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "elf-land.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:remove_unit_overlay",
            id: "$ally_id",
            image: "misc/hero-icon.png",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_55",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Cloaked%20Figure%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Quick, grab him! Don’t let him escape again."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cloaked Figure",
            portrait: "portraits/cloaked.webp",
            text: _("No, no, no more escaping. Please kill me, just make the pain end."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("No, you have hounded me with your riddles for too long. I want some answers. Who are you? What’s behind that black mask?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:transform_unit",
            id: "Cloaked Figure",
            transform_to: "Dark Assassin Uncloaked",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cloaked Figure",
            text: _("Behold, Kaleh, your own worst enemy. Do you now see the irony?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Oh Eloh save us, it’s... it’s an elf."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Keratur, son of Tanuil. What in Eloh’s name are you doing here? How could you do this? We thought you were dead."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("Kaleh, we don’t have time for questions. The water is still rising and we must get our people to safety."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("No matter what you have done, you are one of us, Keratur, and I will not leave you here to die in the darkness. I will carry you myself if I have to."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cloaked Figure",
            portrait: "portraits/uncloaked.webp",
            text: _("So be it. I care not."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "cloaked_figure",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Cloaked Figure",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "cloaked_figure.name",
            value: "Keratur",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "cloaked_figure.hitpoints",
            value: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "cloaked_figure.side",
            value: 1,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_64",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: "11-19",
            y: "0-17",
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22event%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22moveto%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22unit%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Look%2C%20the%20tunnel%20slopes%20sharply%20downwards%20to%20the%20left.%20And%20it%E2%80%99s%20big%20enough%20that%20it%20should%20divert%20most%20of%20the%20rising%20water.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22unit%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22And%20I%20think%20I%20see%20a%20faint%20light%20off%20to%20the%20right.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Zhul%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Could%20it%20be%3F%20Could%20we%20actually%20be%20almost%20out%20of%20this%20seemingly%20never-ending%20darkness%3F%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Look, the tunnel slopes sharply downwards to the left. And it’s big enough that it should divert most of the rising water."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("And I think I see a faint light off to the right."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("Could it be? Could we actually be almost out of this seemingly never-ending darkness?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_65",
        on: "ally_conversation",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "switch",
            variable: "ally_id",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "Grog",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Kaleh",
                    text: _("Grog, thank you so much for leading us out of the caves. We never would have found our way without your help. But with the tunnels flooded, how are you going to find your way back to your people?"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Grog",
                    text: _("Grog proud of little elves too. He would not have made it this far without all your help. Grog is surprised by your bravery and strength."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Grog",
                    text: _("Truth is that Grog not know much of sunlight lands. Sun and stars are scary, everything is open, exposed, no safe places to hide. But Grog cannot go back through all that water. And Grog doesn’t know where to find other tunnels back to his home. He is as lost as elves are."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Grog",
                    text: _("But Grog not afraid. Great leader told Grog to guide and protect elves, and Grog will keep his oath. Grog will follow elves wherever they may go and protect them from danger as best he can. Maybe later, Grog will find another way back down to the caves of his people. But for now, Grog will continue to serve and protect you."),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "Nog",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Kaleh",
                    text: _("Nog, thank you so much for leading us out of the caves. We never would have found our way without your help. But with the tunnels flooded, how are you going to find your way back to your people?"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Nog",
                    text: _("Nog proud of little elves too. He would not have made it this far without all your help. Nog is surprised by your bravery and strength."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Nog",
                    text: _("Truth is that Nog not know much of sunlight lands. Sun and stars are scary, everything is open, exposed, no safe places to hide. But Nog cannot go back through all that water. And Nog doesn’t know where to find other tunnels back to his home. He is as lost as elves are."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Nog",
                    text: _("But Nog not afraid. Great leader told Nog to guide and protect elves, and Nog will keep his oath. Nog will follow elves wherever they may go and protect them from danger as best he can. Maybe later, Nog will find another way back down to the caves of his people. But for now, Nog will continue to serve and protect you."),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "Rogrimir",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Kaleh",
                    text: _("Rogrimir, I want to thank you so much for guiding us out of the caves. We never would have found our way without your help. But with the tunnels flooded, how are you going to find your way back to your people?"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Rogrimir",
                    text: _("Och, it is I who should be congratulating you, laddie. I showed you the way, but it was you and your people who defeated the many perils and obstacles to your escape. In all my years such bravery and courage I have rarely seen."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Rogrimir",
                    text: _("But truly I cannot return the way I came and even if there are other tunnels which lead back down to my homeland, I do not know where to search for them. I know as little about the land above ground as you do."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Rogrimir",
                    text: _("But my king told me to protect you from all dangers, and I plan to keep that oath. I do not like the above ground, it is too open and exposed; I feel that I could be attacked from any direction. But an oath is an oath and so I will follow you and your people wherever you may go and protect you as best I can. The tunnels cannot stay flooded forever; later perhaps if am able to return this way, I may be able to find my way back to my homeland. But for now I am yours to command."),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "Jarl",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Kaleh",
                    text: _("Jarl, I want to thank you so much for guiding us out of the caves. We never would have found our way without your help. But with the tunnels flooded, how are you going to find your way back to your people?"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Jarl",
                    text: _("Och, it is I who should be congratulating you, laddie. I showed you the way, but it was you and your people who defeated the many perils and obstacles to your escape. In all my years such bravery and courage I have rarely seen."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Jarl",
                    text: _("But truly I cannot return the way I came and even if there are other tunnels which lead back down to my homeland, I do not know where to search for them. I know as little about the land above ground as you do."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Jarl",
                    text: _("But my king told me to protect you from all dangers, and I plan to keep that oath. I do not like the above ground, it is too open and exposed; I feel that I could be attacked from any direction. But an oath is an oath and so I will follow you and your people wherever you may go and protect you as best I can. The tunnels cannot stay flooded forever; later perhaps if am able to return this way, I may be able to find my way back to my homeland. But for now I am yours to command."),
                  },
                ],
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Your loyalty is a credit to your people. I am glad indeed to have you fighting by my side."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_67",
