      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_71",
        on: "branch_if_71",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "unit.id",
            not_equals: "Kaleh",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("Kaleh, Kaleh, come to me."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("What is the voice? It sounds so familiar."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("Come out so that I might see you. Your god calls to you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Am I dreaming? Is this real? I’m coming, I’m coming."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Kaleh",
            x: 24,
            y: 22,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_72",
        on: "branch_if_72",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "unit.id",
            equals: "Kaleh",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("Hail Kaleh, it is I, Eloh."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_73",
        on: "branch_if_73",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "unit.id",
            not_equals: "Kaleh",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$talking_unit.id",
            text: _("Kaleh, who are you talking to?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("For now, I appear only to you, for you, Kaleh, are special, you are the Chosen One."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("$talking_unit.name, be quiet, I’ll explain it all later."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_74",
        on: "branch_if_74",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "unit.id",
            equals: "Kaleh",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("Kaleh, who are you talking to?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("For now, I appear only to you, for you, Kaleh, are special, you are the Chosen One."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Be quiet Zhul, I’ll explain it all later."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_75",
        on: "branch_if_75",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "ally_race",
            equals: "dwarf",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("I am sorry I could not have fulfilled your command, but we found ourselves in the middle of a war. We were vastly outnumbered and we needed help. In fact the dwarves have been very helpful. They helped protect us from the trolls and without their guidance we would not have made it out of the caves alive."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_76",
        on: "branch_if_76",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "ally_race",
            not_equals: "dwarf",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("I am sorry I could not have fulfilled your command, but we found ourselves in the middle of a war. We were vastly outnumbered and we needed help. In fact the trolls have been very helpful. They helped protect us from the dwarves and without them we would not have made it out of the caves alive."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_77",
        on: "branch_if_77",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "ally_race",
            equals: "troll",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sergeant Durstrag",
            text: _("A troll! This just gets better and better. We haven’t seen one of your kind up here for many years, but I have a long memory. I still remember the troll raids when I was a youth."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_78",
        on: "branch_if_78",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "ally_race",
            not_equals: "troll",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sergeant Durstrag",
            text: _("A dwarf! This just gets better and better. We haven’t seen one of your kind up here for many years, but we have long memories. I remember how your ‘traders’ used to come up and cheat us out of our valuables. You’ll find we’re not so easy to fool this time."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_79",
        on: "branch_if_79",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "ally_race",
            equals: "troll",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sergeant Durstrag",
            text: _("Oh there is no need to explain, it’s pretty obvious what you’re up to. Here we have a whole legion of elves, consorting with trolls, sneaking up behind our defenses. This looks an awful lot like an invasion to me."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_80",
        on: "branch_if_80",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "ally_race",
            not_equals: "troll",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sergeant Durstrag",
            text: _("Oh there’s no need to explain, it’s pretty obvious what you’re up to. Here we have a whole legion of elves, consorting with dwarves, sneaking up behind our defenses. This looks an awful lot like an invasion to me."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_81",
        on: "new_turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "nym_return",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_69",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: "24-49",
            y: "18-30",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Can you see very far? Do you have any idea where we are?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_70",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$talking_unit.id",
            text: _("We’ve come out on the side of a mountain, overlooking a large valley. The land seems to be much the same as the foothills south of the mountains. The valley is filled with sand dunes, though the center is flat. There seems to be some sort of settlement in the center of the valley. And far to the north I can see something sparkling on the horizon, but I don’t know what it is."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:clear_shroud",
            side: 1,
            xs: "25-48",
            ys: "-1-29",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:clear_shroud",
            side: 1,
            xs: "24-30",
            ys: "18-19",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:clear_shroud",
            side: 1,
            xs: "20-30,22-30,24-30",
            ys: "26,27,28",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:clear_shroud",
            side: 1,
            xs: "47-55,47-53,47-52,47-50,26-48,28-30,34-46",
            ys: "16-25,26,27,28-29,30,31,31",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Eloh",
            type: "Divine Avatar",
            side: 2,
            x: 29,
            y: 21,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Eloh",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_71",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_72",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("But I am not asleep? And yet I can see you? How is this possible?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("Do you doubt my powers? You have come out of the darkness, and I appear unto you to congratulate you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_73",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_74",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("Yes, I have chosen you as the one to lead my people out of danger and death and into a life of eternal salvation. Crossing under the mountains was a very important step, and your destruction of the unbelievers proves your—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "$ally_id",
            x: 20,
            y: 22,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$ally_id",
            text: _("Kaleh, a quick question—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "switch",
            variable: "ally_id",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "Grog",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Kaleh",
                    text: _("Not now Grog, I’m busy."),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "Nog",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Kaleh",
                    text: _("Not now Nog, I’m busy."),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "Rogrimir",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Kaleh",
                    text: _("Not now Rogrimir, I’m busy."),
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: "Jarl",
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Kaleh",
                    text: _("Not now Jarl, I’m busy."),
                  },
                ],
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("What’s this? You did not kill the unbelievers?!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_75",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_76",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("You were weak and foolish, but I forgive you. You must remember, Kaleh, that without my guidance, your people would have died out years ago. Believe in me, I alone can save you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("Now, in the valley live a group of humans who have also seen the light. They may seem strange, but they are my obedient followers. You must trust them, they will show you the way north. Follow them and they will lead you to me."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("What do you mean ‘lead you to me’? You are a god, don’t you exist everywhere? I thought you were going to show us our new home."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("Of course I am! Oh, how little you understand. Do not worry yourself with such distractions, come to me and all will be made clear."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 100,
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Sergeant_Durstrag",
            type: "Human Commander",
            side: 2,
            x: 29,
            y: 24,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Sergeant_Durstrag",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_24",
            type: "Dragoon",
            side: 2,
            x: 30,
            y: 24,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_24",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_25",
            type: "Dragoon",
            side: 2,
            x: 30,
            y: 25,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_25",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_26",
            type: "Swordsman",
            side: 2,
            x: 29,
            y: 23,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_26",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_27",
            type: "Longbowman",
            side: 2,
            x: 29,
            y: 25,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_27",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sergeant Durstrag",
            text: _("I saw the distress signal from the outpost on the bluff. Who in the Dark Lady’s name are you and what have you done with my men?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("My name is Kaleh, and these are my people. We come from the south and unfortunately we found your men dead—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sergeant Durstrag",
            text: _("Dead?! You ‘found’ them you say? You’ll pardon me if I don’t take you at your word. We haven’t seen elves for generations, but we remember your ancient betrayal. What are elves doing sneaking up through the caves out onto our back doorstep?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$ally_id",
            text: _("Well, actually they were fleeing from—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_77",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_78",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Look, if you’ll just let me explain—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_79",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_80",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("No, no. You don’t understand! We were told you could help us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Sir, remember the edict passed down by councilman Noblis? About any foreigners spotted on the borders?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sergeant Durstrag",
            text: _("I have no idea what you’re babbling about, elf, but you’re just lucky you caught me on a good day. You get to explain everything to the Iron Council. Now you and your people just lay down your weapons and we will take you into custody to be judged. They’ll deal with you as they see fit."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            text: _("Everything will be fine. Do as he says."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("I am my own master. I will not be ordered around, not even by you, Eloh."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sergeant Durstrag",
            text: _("What’s that, boy? Are you talking back to me? This isn’t a negotiation. You are on my land, and under my jurisdiction. Lay down your weapons and submit peacefully or I’ll make you sorry you didn’t."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eloh",
            portrait: "portraits/eloh_rage.webp",
            text: _("Kaleh, I am Eloh, bearer of the staff of Ishtar and slayer of the demon-god Zhangor. Submit to him or I shall abandon your people to suffering and death. Your bones will litter the sand dunes, and vultures shall pick at your flesh. I am a just god, Kaleh, but no more forgiving than the harsh desert sun."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Then kill me if you must, but I will not give myself over to those who threaten me and my people. I have not come through peril and darkness just to surrender to one such as you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sergeant Durstrag",
            text: _("You dare defy me?! All who refuse to submit to the authority of the Iron Council shall be killed. By the Dark Lady, I shall not put up with this bickering any longer. To battle, men! Drive those heathens back into the caves!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
