      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_82",
        on: "nym_return",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "kaleh_location",
            kill: "no",
            id: "Kaleh",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:unstore_unit",
            variable: "Nymstats",
            x: "$kaleh_location.x",
            y: "$kaleh_location.y",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("I’m back, Kaleh."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Ah! You scared me, Nym. I didn’t hear you coming."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Of course you didn’t. That’s why it’s called sneaking."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Anyway you’ve really gotten us into a mess. The good news is that the outpost isn’t guarded as heavily as you might think. The garrison seems only half-manned. They obviously didn’t expect any serious attack to come from this direction."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("And what’s the bad news?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("The bad news is that I overheard the commander ordering a special group of his men to get ready to ride north and summon reinforcements. It seems that the humans have a bigger village to the north. This outpost is lightly guarded enough that we might be able to defeat them, but in our weakened state if they bring the full strength of their army against us I fear we may be crushed."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Then we’ll just have to make sure that no messenger escapes this valley to summon reinforcements."),
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "messenger_timer",
            value: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "messengers_incoming",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:show_objectives",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_86",
        on: "undead_emissary",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Undead_Emissary",
            type: "ENightgaunt",
            side: 5,
            x: 34,
            y: 29,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Undead_Emissary",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Undead Emissary",
            text: _("Cursed elves, you tracked your filth through our halls and you defiled our sanctuary. You have besmirched our honor, and we will have our revenge. We are the Order of the Crimson Talon, and even death shall not stop us. You shall rue the day that you ever trespassed into our lair!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Undead Emissary",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Can’t the dead ever just stay dead? And aren’t they trapped by the flooded tunnels and caves?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("Undead don’t have to breathe and I don’t think a little water is going to stop them. Besides, you saw how the ghost just flew through the rock; if they can move through walls then what do they care about flooded tunnels?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Great. So now we’re fighting in a haunted valley."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_side",
            side: 5,
            gold: 150,
            income: 24,
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Undead_Leader",
            type: "Spectre",
            side: 5,
            x: 27,
            y: 36,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Undead_Leader",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_87",
        on: "human_conversation",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("I don’t understand. What are these humans doing here? I’ve never seen so many in one place before."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("Humans aren’t just the bandits and outlaws you’re familiar with from the deserts, Kaleh. Remember that long ago the great human empire of Wesnoth spread all across the known lands. Some of our people say that it was the humans who brought the Great Fall upon us. But to blame others is folly. Eloh says that it was not the darkness without, but the darkness within us that was the cause of our corruption and downfall."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("But now is not a time for preaching. Humans once spread to many lands, and despite all the ravages of time, I have no doubt that at least a few of them have survived. They are a hardy people and quickly adapt to new conditions. I only wish that the same could be said of our brethren."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("There might be other elves somewhere. We can’t be sure."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("No, we can’t. But for now we must deal with the problem at hand. Thank you for the information, Zhul; these humans are good fighters but they are no match for our speed and skill. I grew up fighting in dunes such as these, and I will not be bested by a bunch of ruffians."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_89",
        on: "branch_if_89",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "messenger_timer",
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "messenger_timer",
            value: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sergeant Durstrag",
            text: _("Send forth the messenger and his escort. Go north and bring help as soon as possible!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_rand",
            variable: "loc_x",
            values: "44..51",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_rand",
            variable: "loc_y",
            values: "23..25",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("If that messenger escapes the valley, we’ll be in trouble. We have to stop him!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:micro_ai",
            side: 8,
            ai_type: "messenger_escort",
            action: "add",
            waypoint_x: 42,
