      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_90",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22messenger%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "messenger",
            text: _("No! I must get help!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_91",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22messenger%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Good. We’re safe for now. We just have to defeat Durstrag before he sends another messenger for reinforcements."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:modify_ai",
            side: 8,
            action: "add",
            path: "goal[]",
            goal_kind: "goal",
            goal_value: 10,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_92",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 8,
            y: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "messenger",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("The messenger has escaped! He will surely return with reinforcements. We are doomed!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_93",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Sergeant%20Durstrag%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Don’t worry. We’re not the monsters you seem to think we are. I will not kill you in cold blood."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sergeant Durstrag",
            text: _("Faugh, boy, you know nothing! There are fates worse than death."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Sergeant Durstrag",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("He killed himself rather than surrender to us!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("They killed Sergeant Durstrag! Run for your lives!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22kill%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%222%22%2C%22animate%22%3A%22no%22%2C%22fire_event%22%3A%22no%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22kill%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%225%22%2C%22animate%22%3A%22no%22%2C%22fire_event%22%3A%22no%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("The rest of the humans are fleeing."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Let them go. We have won this battle and I am weary of all this bloodshed."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("What was it that the human Durstrag was so afraid of?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("I don’t know, but I fear we may find out."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("You’re being very cryptic, Kaleh. Now that the battle is over would you care to explain to us who you were talking to back when we first met the humans?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("No, not yet."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("What’s wrong, Kaleh? Don’t you trust us?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Yes, yes of course I do. But it’s just a theory. I don’t want to say more until I have proof. Give me until tomorrow night, then I’ll tell you everything."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("Very well. I’ve trusted your decisions and your leadership so far; I’ll wait a little longer."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("So what do we do now? The land seems to be about the same on the northern side of the mountains as it was on the south. And we can’t hang around here forever. The humans will be back with reinforcements eventually, and the valley is still haunted with undead."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Yes, I think the sooner we leave this valley the better. But we don’t know anything about the surrounding terrain. Without anyone to guide us, we have no idea what perils may be nearby. I don’t like sending our people across foreign lands when I don’t know what’s in front of us. We’ve lost too many people already. I don’t want to lead us into a trap."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("When I was scouting around I think I saw a small oasis near the entrance to this valley. If we move out there we should be out of range of the undead. I think it would be safe, at least for the short term."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("Indeed. Undead ghosts such as these are often bound to the places they died: the farther away they travel, the weaker they are. So if we move out of the immediate vicinity we should be pretty safe."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Good, we’ll move our people out and camp by the oasis. Now, Nym, you know who our best scouts are; I want you to lead a few elves to do some reconnaissance. We’ll send out small groups of scouts to the north, northeast and northwest. Don’t go too far, try not to be seen, and please don’t do anything dangerous. But I want to know what’s out there."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("But hasn’t Eloh told you where to go and what dangers you face?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("She was... rather vague. I know we’re supposed to generally go north, but I want more information before I commit us to a direction."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Don’t you worry about us, Kaleh. We’ll be careful. I’ll organize five bands to scout out the nearby lands. We should be back in about half a day."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Good, until then we’ll settle around that oasis and set up as good a defense as we can. Until I know what’s out there, I’m not taking any chances."),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "do_flooding",
