            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Several hours pass..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Dummy_Unit7",
            type: "Quenoth Scout",
            side: 1,
            x: 58,
            y: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Dummy_Unit7",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Dummy Unit7",
            x: 65,
            y: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dummy Unit7",
            text: _("Eastern scouts, reporting back! If you like sand and hot dust, there’s plenty more out there! No water, or signs of others, we had to turn back."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("No shame in that, Jezhar. Of all the scouts, only Tanstafaal and Nym have yet to return."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("And that has me worried. What if-"),
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "Nymstats.hitpoints",
            value: 12,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:unstore_unit",
            variable: "Nymstats",
            x: 60,
            y: 3,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("In Eloh’s name, Nym, you look terrible. Are you well?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Yes. Just... let me... catch... my breath."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 100,
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Esanoo",
            type: "Merman Netcaster",
            side: 1,
            x: 59,
            y: 3,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Esanoo",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Esanoo",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 200,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Esanoo",
            text: _("Water. Sweet water. By the gods, I thought my scales would fall off."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("What in Uria’s name is that?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Relax, he’s a friend. Just let me explain."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("You’re really beat up, Nym. Are you sure you’re fine?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("I’m fine. But I found someone who really wanted to speak with you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$ally_id",
            text: _("He looks like a half-man half-fish."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Esanoo",
            text: _("Indeed. I come from the ocean, and long have I been looking for you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("The ocean? What are you talking about?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Don’t try to explain, Esanoo. We’ll have to show them instead."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Esanoo",
            text: _("It’s not important. What’s important is that I am an emissary from one who much desires to speak with you, Kaleh. Despite the danger, our wise leader sent me and my brethren to scour the dry land searching for you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("There are more of you? Where are the others?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Esanoo",
            text: _("They have been captured by the foul humans. I just barely managed to hide and escape, with the help of your friend."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("And why should we trust anything you say?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Esanoo",
            text: _("Our leader thought you might be suspicious. She said that what we must talk with you about concerns the fate of your people. Apparently it concerns ‘Yechnagoth’ and ‘Zhangor’. She said that you would understand, Kaleh."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Hmmmm... Yes, yes I think I do. I don’t know why, but I trust you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Esanoo",
            text: _("Thank you, Kaleh. Now I have a favor to ask of you. Our instructions were to find you and to bring you and your people to meet with our wise leader. The problem is that I don’t know where she is hiding."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("You don’t know where to find your leader?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Esanoo",
            text: _("It’s complicated, and I don’t know how much I am allowed to tell you. My people are fighting a desperate war against... against a powerful foe. Many times our enemy has tried to assassinate our wise leader, so she worried that her presence was a danger to the rest of us. So right after she sent us on our mission she went into hiding. I am the youngest member of our group, and so I wasn’t told the location. You must understand, there are spies everywhere. Only the leaders of our group knew, but the rest of them were all captured by those foul humans. They are being held in the settlement to the north. If we are to have any chance of finding our wise leader, we must first rescue them. I would do it myself, but..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("...It would be suicide for you to try to rescue them alone. Of course we will help you!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Esanoo",
            text: _("Thank you, Nym. I am not very good at fighting on the dry ground."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("With you back, Nym, the only scouts yet to return are Tanstafaal’s group."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("They were sent due north. From Esanoo’s description it sounds like they were headed right for the human settlement. I hope nothing bad has happened to them."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Things are coming to a head, Tanstafaal and our new friends are in trouble. Time is of the essence, so let’s move out as soon as possible."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Dummy Unit1",
          },
